direct_body_template:
Dear {salutation},

I am writing on behalf of {event_host} to invite you to speak at {event_name}, taking place on {event_date} at {event_location}.

The event is {event_description}. Your work in {topic_fit} would bring valuable insight to our audience, and we would be honored to discuss a speaking role that fits your interests and availability.

If you are open to the conversation, I would be glad to share the proposed format, timing, audience, and honorarium details.

Sincerely,
{sender_name}
{sender_title}
{sender_organization}
{sender_email}

routed_body_template:
Dear {route_greeting},

I am writing on behalf of {event_host} to invite {full_name}, {title} at {organization}, to speak at {event_name}, taking place on {event_date} at {event_location}.

The event is {event_description}. {full_name}'s work in {topic_fit} would bring valuable insight to our audience. Would you please forward this invitation to the appropriate person or advise us on the correct speaking-inquiry route?

I would be glad to share the proposed format, timing, audience, and honorarium details.

Sincerely,
{sender_name}
{sender_title}
{sender_organization}
{sender_email}
